# Mandatory Development Workflow

Before changing any repository artifact, read and follow
[`skills/develop-by-standards/SKILL.md`](../../skills/develop-by-standards/SKILL.md).
Treat its preflight, verification, semantic-audit, and handoff steps as required
acceptance gates. Do not claim completion while a required check is failing or
a known deviation is undisclosed.
